---
model: vertex-ai/gemini-1.5-pro
input:
  schema:
    type: object
    properties:
      customer_name:
        type: string
        description: The name of the customer
      issue_category:
        type: string
        enum: [billing, technical, account, other]
      urgency:
        type: integer
        minimum: 1
        maximum: 5
    required: [customer_name, issue_category]
---
# Customer Support Script

Hello {{customer_name}},

I understand you're experiencing a {{issue_category}} issue today. 
I've noted that the urgency level is set to {{urgency}}.

How can I assist you further with your {{issue_category}} request?
